{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal multiprofile setup using scgpt RNA encoder, ViT-L image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.519957 and F1 of 0.479067 are lower than previous high-performing configurations using scvi_n200 RNA and ViT-L, suggesting the scgpt RNA encoder may not achieve the same performance. The role of scgpt's complexity or interactions with other components remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative RNA encoders."
}

